      "body": "Lumina Note\n\n一款开源的本地优先笔记软件，内置 AI Agent 能力。\n\n主要特点：\n- AI Agent 可直接读写笔记、创建文件、语义搜索\n- 知识图谱可视化双链笔记\n- 支持 OpenAI/Claude/Gemini/Ollama 等多种模型\n- Markdown 编辑器支持 LaTeX 和代码高亮\n- 基于 Tauri + React，跨平台桌面应用\n\n<img width=\"2703\" height=\"1477\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/753cde38-c107-42b4-b48e-f26e0360df03\" />\n\n<img width=\"2695\" height=\"1478\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef35553d-f707-4294-af20-1685a5f47c66\" />\n\n<img width=\"2711\" height=\"1477\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2baefff6-b822-4584-8e0b-2c5b06d1ef2f\" />\n\nGitHub: https://github.com/blueberrycongee/Lumina-Note",
